cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CrystaSee, please cite it using the concept DOI below; it always resolves to the latest version."
title: "CrystaSee: Interactive Crystal Structure Visualization and Analysis"
version: "V1.13"
date-released: 2026-11-26
authors:
  - family-names: "Ye"
    given-names: "Yang"
    # 可选：补全 ORCID 与单位后取消下面两行的注释
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
    # affiliation: "Your institution"
repository-code: "https://github.com/EricYeah-CN/CrystaSee"
url: "https://crystasee.cn"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - crystallography
  - crystal-structure visualization
  - CIF
  - powder-diffraction
abstract: "CrystaSee is an interactive desktop application for crystal structure visualization and analysis, including CIF structure rendering, powder diffraction simulation, molecular stacking and crystal-structure disorder handling."

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DOI 回填区（发布 GitHub Release 并由 Zenodo 归档后填写）
#
# 本仓库采用「概念 DOI」作为主引用标识：它指向 CrystaSee 的所有版本，
# 后续发布新版本时无需更改引用。Zenodo 会同时生成一个版本 DOI，
# 版本 DOI 请记在 docs/DOI-WORKFLOW.md，用于需要精确复现的场景。
#
# 步骤：把下面 identifiers 段的注释取消，将 <CONCEPT_DOI> 换成
#       形如 10.5281/zenodo.1234567 的真实概念 DOI，然后提交推送。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# identifiers:
#   - type: doi
#     value: "<CONCEPT_DOI>"
#     description: "Concept DOI - resolves to the latest version of CrystaSee"
